<SECTION image-layout="blank" vertical-align="end">
  <DIV class="body">
    <COLUMNS colWidths="[50,50]">
      <DIV data-vertical-align="end">
        <H1 style="text-align: left"><B>"72% of climate startups cite scaling manufacturing as their primary barrier."</B></H1>
      </DIV>
      <DIV data-vertical-align="end">
        <P>Breakthrough Energy's 2024 portfolio survey reveals manufacturing as the dominant constraint across all climate sectors. Unlike software scaling, hardware requires physical infrastructure, specialized workforce, and supply chain coordination that venture capital cannot easily solve.</P>
        <P>Leading venture partners report manufacturing partnerships as their top due diligence priority. Companies with established production relationships achieve 2.3x faster time-to-market and 40% lower capital requirements compared to those building greenfield facilities.</P>
      </DIV>
    </COLUMNS>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>